gametitle=Drakengard (SLES-52322) CRC 79585776

[Drakengard Overhaul]
author=Shade
description=Gameplay, camera, aiming, aerial and Angelus rework, render distance, widescreen and widescreen HUD, menus, 50 Hz retune. One switch for the whole mod (European version).
